<!--
  Small icon for the media playback notification.

  Android renders a notification's small icon as a mask: only the alpha channel
  is used and the system applies its own tint. A full-colour launcher icon
  (audio_service's default, `mipmap/ic_launcher`) therefore collapses into a
  white or grey blob. This is a flat, single-colour music note so the icon
  stays legible on the head unit's status bar and in the shade.
-->
